{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_05",
  "title": "多蘿西的承諾",
  "storyCode": "DV-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fc10706b4e5952c44afa160d58dc3a2eb395ff86e147bfd5197a2d7d010842b9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“嗨，瑪麗，我有多久沒給你寫信了？抱歉，在那件事之後，我總是提不起跟你說話的勇氣。\n昨天我一整夜沒睡，腦子裡亂七八糟的，都是小時候的回憶。\n還記得你十五歲生日那天，我們一起偷偷爬到了中央城區那座大法官雕像的肩膀上。\n你開玩笑說，這是違法行為，等你當上警察之後，你隨時都能把我逮捕。\n而我說......我說了什麼？\n‘每一個人都應有被公平正義支撐的權利。’\n那時候的我，一定沒有想過幾年後自己會在哪裡。\n文明是脆弱的。離開移動城市以後，人和馱獸的區別越來越小。\n今天的我，早就忘了如何談論公平，每一天佔據我大腦的就只有生存而已。\n是的，我變成了你和過去的我最討厭的那類人。\n（大量劃掉的痕跡）\n如果我還有機會回到文明的懷抱中呢？如果我還有機會做回過去的自己呢？\n再過一周就是你的生日，你不知道我有多想給你一個驚喜。\n（大片空白後接潦草得多的字跡）\n他們在拿我們做危險的實驗。我能做的只有努力活下去。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "領、領隊，你看我們射出去的箭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......停在了半空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "射向她和各處儀器的箭矢就像被一面看不見的牆擋住了，再無法前進。\n奇怪的是，它們也並沒有彈開。\n就如同有無數無形的手將這些鋒利的鐵器輕柔地握在了掌心。\n多蘿西抬起一隻手，指尖輕輕觸碰了一下其中一支箭。\n箭頭發出嗡的一聲輕響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "臥倒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "領隊，這怎麼回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "整齊劃一的鐵器墜地聲傳來。\n全部的箭矢都落到了地面上，但落到地面上的並不是箭矢的全部。每一支箭的箭頭都消失了，取而代之的是一個極為整齊的切面。\n不，它們不是消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃琳娜，你也聽到剛才那聲輕響了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是金屬極快振動時發出的響動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些箭頭是被震碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們這位弗蘭克斯主任......她的源石技藝有多強？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不完全是源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是她的技術，她可是源石技藝應用領域的專家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......拓荒者們傷不到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形狀奇特的物體",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_533_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說得對。比起擔心她，我更應該擔心一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保護好喬伊絲，她的狀態依舊很不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有桑尼他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......燃燒瓶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "全都拿出來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扔出去，不要瞄準一個地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形狀奇特的物體",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_533_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼......不願意聽我的話呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我真的不想看到你們受傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這句話......你怎麼......不對其他被你騙到實驗台上的人說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有騙他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們很安全......非常安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要實驗成功了，他們就再也不用面對危險的荒野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "桑尼，這不也是你的願望嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "形狀奇特的物體",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_533_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "領隊，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩姆......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "領隊......哈......桑尼，逃吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帶著活下來的人，離開這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "逃到......荒野上......這些大公司......追不上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "荒野......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，我們是......拓荒者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈哈！他們害怕荒野，我們......才不怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "要逃嗎？\n從這裡轉身出去，放棄其他同伴，放棄要一個答案。\n這樣能活下去。這不就是自己唯一想要的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "桑尼，你在寫什麼......寫信？哈哈，難道說城裡還有人在等你的信嗎？你這個幸運的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說不定......這會變成證據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼證據？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓外面的人知道我們的遭遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還以為我們只是去救迪克他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬一失敗了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想留下點什麼。薩姆，就算我們都活不成了，我也想別人知道，我們曾經掙扎過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他當然想活下去。\n但他更想讓所有人聽見自己的叫喊聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "憑什麼我們的機會......只能等著你們來給？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不公平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他在地上摸到了一支箭。\n箭頭被磨平了，沒關係，他還有手。\n礦石病給他帶來了這麼多噩運，唯有一點，它也讓他擁有了一點點力量。\n跟厲害角色們相比或許微不足道，卻足以把這根箭折成兩半。\n尖銳的截面能夠成為武器，幫他解決眼前的敵人，為他打破這強加於他身上的桎梏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別再往前走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斷箭在他手中失去了控制，緊跟著是他的手。\n一股看不見的巨大力量鉗住了他的手腕，逼迫他停下腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的研究從來就不該被拿來對付你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它最初被設計出來，是為了讓你們能輕鬆地對付荒地上的野獸，越過艱險的地形障礙，在天災面前爭取逃生機會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它是為了保護你們啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說什麼......保護......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你問過我們的意願了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他要前進，越是有人壓著他，他就越要前進。\n箭的斷面磨破了他的掌心，越來越多的鮮血淌下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放棄吧，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的回答是，我不願意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
