    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們會回到陰雲的遮蔽之下，受到其他國家的鉗制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我們必須擁有比他們更先進的技術......能夠跨越距離，精準地將我們的武器送到任意地點的技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，哥倫比亞需要“導航”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很聰明，克魯尼，而且你比一般的聰明人要務實得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等這次交易完成，我們很期待與萊茵生命的新總轄達成更多合作。"
