      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也許你真該早點說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說它們是實驗的副產品，那實驗的主要目的到底是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一種新的替代傳統施術單元的技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能量科負責的就是你看到的這種特殊物質的研發。它對微振動非常敏感，能夠充當......接收並編碼神經信號的媒介。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們管它叫“遞質”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "理想情況下，它能讓源石技藝適應性普通的人搖身一變成為優秀的術師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以......就連副產品......都能造成這麼大的......威脅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奧利維亞，我實在沒辦法一邊戰鬥一邊做學術報告。"
    },
