      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白你為這個實驗付出了很多的心血，也明白你對多蘿西的感情，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，奧利維亞，你再念下去都快讓我想起姐姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個項目對我來說很重要，可多蘿西的狀態明顯不對......我是那種連輕重緩急都分不清的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是需要......唔......好好想一想。"
