      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "整個實驗室裡，多蘿西最不想讓我們靠近的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃琳娜，瞄準她身後——施放你的源石技藝！"
