    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沙粒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "實驗室裡到處都是沙粒，我們身上也是......因為太細小了所以很難注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃琳娜，繼續找受試者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去阻止多蘿西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_530_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，全部試劑都裝好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，去359號基地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_530_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您竟然打算親自去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我說得不夠明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_530_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，只是我還以為那邊人夠多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告訴我，為什麼越是突破性的研究越需要重複多次實驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_530_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為怕出錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為關鍵的結果必須要絕對可靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_530_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弗蘭克斯主任......不可信任嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多蘿西？情感給予了她強大的動力，令她創造出了驚人的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但過於豐富的情感在關鍵時刻也可能會變成她的軟肋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_530_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那還有埃琳娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我比你更希望她能儘快成長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她的成就動機很強烈，可經歷過的事還太少。沒有我的提醒，她未必能做出最合適的決策。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾，整個萊茵生命，最可靠的人只有我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默醫生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳......咳咳，你好，弗蘭克斯主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是怎麼移動到我面前的？我以為振動膜會阻斷你四肢的神經信號傳導。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是醫生，我對人類的身體比你還要熟悉一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我讓你們很難受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再過一會就好，實驗就快成功了，到那時候，我會立即解除你們的行動限制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那之後的成功，真的能抵消此刻的傷害嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看那些正在掙扎的人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家別......放棄！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉住......拉住我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當眼裡只有未來的時候，人會選擇性忽視眼前正在發生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣的人，我在萊茵生命見過很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是弗蘭克斯主任......多蘿西，你和他們並不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當你注視著桑尼和其餘拓荒者的時候，你的眼睛裡有淚光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能感受他們的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......這一時的痛苦，和永無止境的痛苦，究竟哪一種更讓人無法忍受呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫默醫生，他們的人生陷進了泥沼裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想拉住他們，想讓他們得到我和你曾經擁有的機會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當一個正在掙扎的溺水之人感覺到有人在拉扯他，他很有可能掙扎得更厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這真的是拒絕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥水封住了他們的口舌，可我能聽見他們的求救聲，我伸出了手，更不會在即將抓住他們的時候鬆開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然而你必須停下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你的無人機？什麼時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和你說話的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弗蘭克斯主任，在離開萊茵生命之後，我去過很多地方，有一些環境比你這漫天沙子的實驗室更惡劣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "時刻保持醫療器械的潔淨是戰地醫生的必修課。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即便如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多蘿西......果然不肯放棄啊，誰讓她也這麼死腦筋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（手麻得更厲害了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（再電一下嗎？唉，再電下去我的手腕神經都要廢了吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "光？我的法術嗎？喬伊絲，以前的你可沒這麼喜歡我的魔術表演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星星......很亮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在遠方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在看哪裡......告訴我，你到底在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不是你在看什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而是......你知道什麼......你是不是得到了一些我和奧利維亞感受不到的訊息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在光裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼......動起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，你本來就失去了意識......所以振動膜對你沒有那麼大影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你指的方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也是所有銀色造物聚集的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道消失的人們在哪裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快看，領隊，那裡有一扇門打開了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "門......開了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，小心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有振動都停止了。\n銀色造物瞬間分解，化作一攤攤毫無威脅的液體。\n多蘿西停下了動作，即便赫默的無人機正抵著她的後頸，她也沒有反抗。\n她的眼睛裡只有那扇門，還有門後的一切。\n那是她發誓要保護的，也是她背負著的她和無數人的夢想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
